<view class="page"><text class="title">看见一季耕耘。</text><view class="intro muted">资料影像非直播；真实设备待接入。</view>
 <button class="secondary passport-entry" bindtap="productPassport">查看产品批次履历原型</button>
 <block wx:if="{{!selected}}">
 <input class="input" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索农场或产区"/>
 <view wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id" class="surface"><image class="media" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button class="row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row-copy"><text class="heading">{{item.title}}</text><text class="small muted">{{item.region}} · 摄像头{{item.camera}}</text></view><view class="chevron"/></button><text class="small muted">示例地块 · 认购方案待确认</text></view><view wx:if="{{!filtered.length}}" class="empty muted">没有匹配的示例农场，请调整关键词。</view>
 </block><block wx:else>
 <image class="media" src="{{selected.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="heading gap">{{selected.title}}</text>
 <scroll-view scroll-x="{{true}}" class="farm-tabs"><view class="tab-line"><button class="{{tab === 'overview' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="overview" bindtap="changeTab">农场概览</button><button class="{{tab === 'production' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="production" bindtap="changeTab">生产动态</button><button class="{{tab === 'plan' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="plan" bindtap="changeTab">认购方案</button><button class="{{tab === 'tracking' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="tracking" bindtap="changeTab">履约跟踪</button></view></scroll-view>
 <view class="note">本地交互原型。生产动态和履约步骤为虚构流程示例，不是地块真实作业、直播或实际订单。</view>
 <block wx:if="{{tab === 'overview'}}"><view class="surface"><text class="heading">农场与公开范围</text><view class="kv"><text>地块说明</text><text class="muted">{{selected.region}} · {{selected.crop}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>经营主体</text><text class="muted">{{selected.operator}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>摄像头</text><text class="muted">{{selected.camera}}</text></view><view class="small muted gap">上线仅公开已授权摘要与媒体，不公开原始GPS、家庭资料或私人成本。</view></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">摄像头画面入口</text><image src="{{selected.image}}" class="media" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="small muted">资料图片，不是监控画面。设备未接入，不提供“直播中”或假视频进度。</text></view><button class="primary gap" bindtap="follow">{{followed ? '取消关注' : '保存关注'}}</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{tab === 'production'}}"><view class="surface"><text class="heading">一季生产时间线（示例）</text><view wx:for="{{timeline}}" wx:key="id" class="timeline-item"><text class="small muted">{{item.date}}</text><text class="timeline-title">{{item.title}}</text><view>{{item.copy}}</view><text class="pill gap">{{item.state}}</text></view></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{tab === 'plan'}}"><view class="surface"><text class="heading">单季葡萄认购（示例方案）</text><view class="kv"><text>假设份额</text><text>5公斤 / 份（示例）</text></view><view class="kv"><text>价格</text><text class="muted">待运营方确认</text></view><view class="kv"><text>交付</text><text class="muted">产品等级、采收与配送待约定</text></view><view class="small muted gap">消费者平台服务免费，但实际产品、运费等价款须明示。摄像头和记录查看不等于承担农业经营权。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="contract">预览合同要点（非合同）</button><button class="primary gap" bindtap="intention">{{intent ? '已保存演示意向，查看跟踪' : '保存认购意向草稿'}}</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{tab === 'tracking'}}"><view class="surface"><text class="heading">履约步骤预览</text><view class="pill">{{intent ? '已保存本地演示意向' : '尚未保存演示意向'}}</view><view wx:for="{{tracking}}" wx:key="title" class="timeline-item"><text class="timeline-title">{{index + 1}}. {{item.title}}</text><view class="muted">{{item.copy}}</view></view></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">售后问题草稿</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{afterSale}}" bindinput="afterSaleEdit" placeholder="填写测试问题，不发送真实投诉"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="saveAfterSale">保存本地问题草稿</button><view wx:if="{{savedAfterSale}}" class="success">已保存本地草稿：{{savedAfterSale}}。未送达经营主体。</view></view></block>
 <block wx:else><view class="surface"><text class="heading">认购约定要点预览</text><view class="timeline-item">1. 经营主体、产品份额、价格与费用须真实确认。</view><view class="timeline-item">2. 约定生产信息公开范围，保护农户隐私。</view><view class="timeline-item">3. 明确等级、数量、采收、配送、验收及售后。</view><view class="timeline-item">4. 约定自然灾害、减产、取消及退款处理，不承诺固定收益。</view><view class="note">仅用于UI展示，不是完整法律文本，不点击签署、不创建订单、不付款。真实合同须专业审核及签署接口。</view><button class="secondary" data-id="plan" bindtap="changeTab">返回认购方案</button></view></block>
 <button class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回农场列表</button></block>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="demo-foot">不收款、不形成真实合同 · 消费者不收平台服务费</view></view>
